                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f560069a-5b84-3fba-8fdb-1f72f23322ca",
                        "entry_id": "d3596fdd-3997-3707-906d-abadc1b4e522",
                        "glosses": [
                            "eenvoudig; zo vereenvoudigd dat het niet meer waar is"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "te"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "09048d16-6bb5-45b0-9598-431257e81883",
                                "sense_id": "f560069a-5b84-3fba-8fdb-1f72f23322ca",
                                "text": "Natuurlijk moet je kritisch zijn. Er valt veel af te dingen op de simplistische en seksistische tegenstelling tussen mannen die per definitie daders zijn en de vrouwen die zij tot prooi maken."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7ff0a3f-b291-46bc-8fbe-4db6adc2cae5",
                                "sense_id": "f560069a-5b84-3fba-8fdb-1f72f23322ca",
                                "text": "Dat is te simplistisch geredeneerd, aldus Huisman. \"Wij onderzoeken ook vrouwen die in de eerste decennia van de vorige eeuw zijn opgegroeid. Voor velen was het not done om te gaan studeren. Je gaat dus voorbij aan de maatschappelijke omstandigheden als je alleen naar IQ-scores kijkt.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dfed993a-bce3-3375-99b6-cc911018afe4",
                        "entry_id": "d3596fdd-3997-3707-906d-abadc1b4e522",
                        "glosses": [
                            "eenvoudig"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "76190d71-e60d-48d8-9569-eb1c55915b76",
                                "sense_id": "dfed993a-bce3-3375-99b6-cc911018afe4",
                                "text": "Simplistisch gezegd zorgen de golven in de magnetron ervoor dat de moleculen in voedsel meer gaan bewegen en daardoor wordt het warmer."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "16db6108-7fca-4bf3-994d-caf290b0e36d",
                        "source_entry_id": "d3596fdd-3997-3707-906d-abadc1b4e522",
                        "source_sense_id": "f560069a-5b84-3fba-8fdb-1f72f23322ca",
                        "target_lang_word": "simplistic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "simplistic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ca65262-7522-300c-8860-517f9764ec66",
                                        "entry_id": "307948f0-ff3e-3c6d-9e7f-260b20fbde65",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Overly simple."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd57e06e-7964-44be-8d51-2997722ea9b7",
                                                "sense_id": "4ca65262-7522-300c-8860-517f9764ec66",
                                                "text": "At one time, I was extremely skeptical of such simplistic medicine until observing a reflexologist at work and finding that many of the patients showed steady improvement in cases where official medical practitioners had recommended surgery or prescribed the usual quantum of pills. Along with the foot massage, the reflexologist recommended herbal teas to her clients."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b709cd75-8b4e-47af-846d-b03dd648a7c7",
                                                "sense_id": "4ca65262-7522-300c-8860-517f9764ec66",
                                                "text": "This simplistic method of using herbs isolates the disease from the person and the chemical aspects of an herb from its overall individual therapeutic effects."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ffc0604-87f5-4adf-bac6-a41b3addb0d4",
                                                "sense_id": "4ca65262-7522-300c-8860-517f9764ec66",
                                                "text": "It might also be worth taking the simplistic claims of some of the herbal health books with just a bit more than a pinch of salt: if you do decide to try feverfew tea, or a liver flush mixture, do it for yourself, not for someone trying to sell a magazine or book."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "232193d1-2d3a-31c3-95a5-2430a0587c7d",
                                        "entry_id": "307948f0-ff3e-3c6d-9e7f-260b20fbde65",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a manner that simplifies a concept or issue so that its nuance and complexity are lost or important details are overlooked."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba052fbe-e814-4b14-8439-7c442f8ffba1",
                                                "sense_id": "232193d1-2d3a-31c3-95a5-2430a0587c7d",
                                                "text": "(Mao's) reliance on simplistic Soviet interpretations was reflected in his dismissal of Hitler as \"a mere will-less puppet of the reactionary capitalists.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6603ee27-ddb3-4197-8d0e-2b2f0710dde1",
                                                "sense_id": "232193d1-2d3a-31c3-95a5-2430a0587c7d",
                                                "text": "The cliché is not untrue, but, like all generalisations, it distorts reality so that overly simplistic judgments have to be tempered by a few qualifications."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70d0205f-178b-403f-8a34-3ba93ec58417",
                                                "sense_id": "232193d1-2d3a-31c3-95a5-2430a0587c7d",
                                                "text": "\"There are some things that RFK Jr. gets right,\" says former CDC director Dr. Tom Frieden. \"We do have a chronic disease crisis in this country, but we need to avoid simplistic solutions and stick with the science.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
